job-description-accountant = Maintain the Coalition Administration Office’s financial records and assist with budgets, payroll, and audits.
job-description-sr = Lead the Coalition Administration Office, coordinate Haven’s Rest operations, and oversee access and administrative policy.
job-description-secretary = Maintain official records, process administrative work, and support the Superintendent and Dispatcher.
job-description-stc = Coordinate sector traffic, manage docking activity, and dispatch the appropriate public services.
job-description-sheriff = Lead the Coalition Warden’s Office, set enforcement priorities, and keep the sector safe.
job-description-bailiff = Serve as the Warden’s chief deputy, supervise internal operations, manage prisoners, and maintain readiness.
job-description-senior-officer = Supervise Deputy Wardens in the field, coordinate responses, and uphold Coalition law.
job-description-deputy = Patrol the sector, respond to incidents, investigate offenses, and enforce Coalition law.
job-description-plant-manager = Lead the Public Works Department and oversee power generation, machinery, construction, structural repair, and general maintenance.
job-description-plant-technician = Maintain power systems and machinery, construct and repair structures, and handle general engineering work. Clean public areas only when engineering work does not require attention.
job-description-food-service = Support food service wherever needed, including kitchens, bars, hydroponics, dining areas, and hospitality.
job-description-doc = Lead Nightingale General Hospital, oversee patient care and medical supplies, and maintain the hospital’s clinical operations.
job-description-medical-nurse = Provide nursing care, monitor patients, administer treatment, and support the hospital’s medical team.
job-description-cargotech = Process requisitions and deliveries, manage stored materials, and keep supplies moving where they are needed.
job-description-contractor = Fulfill profitable contracts throughout the sector.

